  "title": "4-bit Binary Carry-Lookahead Adder",
  "description": "Build a 4-bit adder that computes A + B using parallel generate/propagate carry logic instead of a ripple-carry chain. A 7483 is prohibited; use only 2-input XOR, AND, and OR gates and reuse shared product terms.",
